Package: maio-cluster
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ShieldDog-ACE <shielddog-ace@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/ShieldDog-ACE/maio-cluster
Description: lightweight llama.cpp model manager and Ollama-compatible service
 maio registers, downloads and deletes GGUF models, runs local inference with
 llama.cpp and exposes a minimal Ollama-compatible HTTP API to the LAN.
 .
 The package installs the maio binary, a default configuration with start on
 boot enabled, and a systemd service.
